Error [jet.DeepCheckReachesEffect]: This deep check uses the effect `IO`
  --> tests/ui/deep_check_effect.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     #On(.Deep) {
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A deep check runs only where `--deep-checks` keeps it, so it may not act on the world outside the program, even through a call.
 Fix: Move the work that uses `IO` out of the `#On(.Deep)` body.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0713
